**Step 1 – Ride from Home to Office**

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "123 Main Street",
    "destination": "456 Park Avenue",
    "max_cost": 30.0
  }
}
```

**Step 2 – Grocery Delivery Order**

```json
{
  "name": "grocery_delivery_order",
  "arguments": {
    "location": "789 Broadway",
    "items": ["milk", "bread", "eggs", "apples"],
    "max_delivery_cost": 10.0
  }
}
```

**Step 3 – Ride from Office to Friend’s House**

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "456 Park Avenue",
    "destination": "321 Elm Street",
    "max_cost": 20.0
  }
}
```

**Step 4 – Ride from Friend’s House back Home**

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "321 Elm Street",
    "destination": "123 Main Street",
    "max_cost": 25.0
  }
}
```

These function calls will schedule your rides and grocery delivery within the specified budget limits.
